{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hi, this is Appleseeds Studio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alpha Canis Major  is a story about finding courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will play and control two elves exploring the inner world of a girl named Ming, who suffers from depression. As you collect items to find the courage, the story of Ming gradually unfolds...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c6The demo of <i>Alpha Canis Major\u00a0</i>is now available. \u25c6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo features the <strong>entire first chapter</strong> of the game, including full story content and core gameplay. Estimated playtime: 2<strong>\u00a0hours</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a world where dreams and reality intertwine.<br>Collect items, uncover hidden paths, and piece together the truth behind the protagonist's journey.<br><i>Note: Combat and other upcoming features will not appear in this demo.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Both English and Chinese</strong> are supported, feel free to choose your preferred language.<br>We hope the starlight will guide you toward your own truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7If you enjoy this game, please consider adding it to your wishlist; it means a lot to us. Thank you so much :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6The fusion of reality and fantasy elements shapes the world and characters of &quot;Alpha Canis Major &quot; \u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812880/extras/\u89d2\u8272\u4ecb\u7ecd-EN.jpg?t=1751312625\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 More characters are in development!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6The complement of art and text, for a more immersive experience of the story\u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812880/extras/\u65e5\u8bb0\u754c\u9762.png?t=1751312625\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c730+ doodle diaries waiting to be unlocked</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7Chat logs, blogs, and item interaction stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6Rich artistic expression\u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812880/extras/\u63d2\u753b\u5c55\u793a.png?t=1751312625\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 Beautiful illustration CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 Adorable pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7 Stylised graffiti</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6Countless maps and hidden corners quietly await your discovery\u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812880/extras/\u5730\u56fe\u5c55\u793a.png?t=1751312625\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25c7Every step forward brings you closer to your heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u25c6More content is on the way!\u25c6</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812880?t=1751312625","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812880/c9153b0a3ef023c1fdf0195fbe7a0e1fbbf6bb7a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751312625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812880/0622a1d24299205ed23eca5398